msgstr ""

#: ../content/agent/chat/chat.rst:275
msgid "The preview uses the real chat module. Other agents have to be available for chatting to preview all features."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/agent/chat/chat.rst:277
msgid "If mixed content warning is displayed in the browser console, an administrator has to check that the system configuration setting ``HttpType`` is properly set. The website must run on the same protocol for the chat widget to work."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/agent/chat/chat.rst:279
